{"id": "EUVD-2026-102974", "enisaUuid": "6884086e-142b-3276-9a35-f9649632cfbc", "description": "Allegro Ralph through 20260902.1 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows authenticated staff users to bypass rack model permissions because RalphPermission skips checks for views without a queryset. Attackers can call DCAssetsView and SRRacksAPIView at /api/rack/<id> and /api/server_room/<id> to read asset hostnames, serials and management IPs, and to modify, move or create racks.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:40", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:39:40", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/ralph-dc-view-rack-api-missing-authorization", "https://github.com/allegro/ralph/blob/20260902.1/src/ralph/dc_view/views/api.py#L17-L96", "https://github.com/allegro/ralph/blob/20260902.1/src/ralph/lib/permissions/api.py#L194-L209", "https://github.com/allegro/ralph", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/allegro-ralph-through-20260902.1-missing-authorization-in-data-center-rack-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7m2f-c6pw-4f2h", "CVE-2026-111683"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "de9ac952-f02c-3b80-9e0c-786d35fbe14e", "product": {"name": "ralph", "vendor": {"name": "Allegro"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226420260902.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "7c38ae09-d17d-37a4-8d10-c27575e80b34", "vendor": {"name": "Allegro"}}], "isExploited": false}